# Run logs land here (gitignored). One folder per day, holding two files:
#   runs.jsonl  every event and one row per run, append-only
#   runs.md     every run's written record, one marked section each
# Plus workers/ when a run was dispatched, holding that worker's raw output.
# Never hand-edit runs.md: the <!-- awo:run … --> markers are how the record is
# split per run, for `awo log show` and for the hosted dashboard.
